        "custom_VDY484": {
          "type": "custom",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"btn\" data-toggle=\"modal\" data-target=\"#howtouse\"><i class=\"fa fa-play\"><\/i> How to use?<\/a>\n\n<!-- Modal -->\n<div class=\"modal fade\" id=\"howtouse\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n  <div class=\"modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered\">\n    <div class=\"modal-content\">\n      <div class=\"modal-body\">\n        \n       <iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"400\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/CGLl7kJLu8o?si=mUGcO2i8FprOHEQL\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"close\" data-dismiss=\"modal\" aria-label=\"Close\">\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\">Close<\/span>\n        <\/button>\n      <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n  <\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<style>\n.modal{\nz-index:99999;\n}\n.modal-backdrop.show {\n  opacity: 0;\n  z-index: -1;\n}\n.modal-open .modal:before {\n  background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n}<\/style>"
          }
        },
        "tab_wPGYYQ": {
          "type": "tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "BASE MEMBERSHIP",
            "content": "<p>The base MyoLift™ QT allows you to try out our premium app features free for 30 days. After that you will have the option to upgrade to a monthly, yearly, or lifetime membership.<\/p><p>Base App Features: My plan, live webinars, customer support & app free mode.<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_UBdd8N": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "LIFETIME PREMIUM MEMBERSHIP",
            "content": "<p>The Lifetime MyoLift™ QT comes with all premium app features for an unlimited amount of time. <\/p><p>Lifetime App Features: My plan, live webinars, customer support & app free mode,rewards, custom sessions, 1:1 esthetician connect & Ai skin analysis<\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "c470f05f-1b5f-4fc2-8e60-fc45d6f483ed": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's Included",
            "content": "<ul><li>MyoLift™ QT Device <\/li><li>Forehead Mask<\/li><li>Lip Mask<\/li><li>Eye Mask<\/li><li>Jowl Mask<\/li><li>Neck Mask (2 electrodes)<\/li><li>2oz Restore Gel<\/li><li>2oz Replenish<\/li><li>Lead Wire<\/li><li>Charger<\/li><\/ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who is this for?",
            "content": "<p>• Those looking to reduce fine lines & wrinkles<\/p><p>• Those looking to maintain a youthful appearance<\/p><p>• Those who want the spa treatment and results at home and on the go<\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "951d62a3-d4c7-4864-9c84-04d5894a1fc3": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping & Handling",
            "content": "<p>Free USA Ground shipment, Orders are processed within 2 business day.<\/p><p>International Orders Ships within 3 business day. <\/p><p>International customers are required to pay Duty with their local custom agency. <\/p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
